(7463835, 1183990, 37858, '<td valign="top">I really like the balance in this image, especially the use of the outcropping to be a counterweight to the fireworks.  The sky and reflections just add to the whole presentation.  I''d give this a ribbon.</td>', 'I really like the balance in this image, especially the use of the outcropping to be a counterweight to the fireworks.  The sky and reflections just add to the whole presentation.  I''d give this a ribbon.', '2016-07-10 19:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
