(7463838, 1183986, 37858, '<td valign="top">Front page material IMHO.  I like the peacefulness of the image.  I do think it would have been even better with a couple of people in the chairs, enjoying the stars and glow, but that is just a matter of personal taste I suppose.</td>', 'Front page material IMHO.  I like the peacefulness of the image.  I do think it would have been even better with a couple of people in the chairs, enjoying the stars and glow, but that is just a matter of personal taste I suppose.', '2016-07-10 19:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
